    "/auth/google/event": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Auth"
        ],
        "description": "\n \n1. **Register the Event**  \n   Navigate to the following URL in your browser to register the event:  \n     [Register Event](https://undefined/register-event/)  \n   Copy the **sseId** from the response. This will be used in subsequent steps.\n\n2. **Obtain the Access Token ID**  \n   Open a new browser tab and use the **sseId** obtained in step 1 with the following endpoint:  \n     [Obtain Access Token](https://undefined/auth/google/login?sse_id=<your_sseId>)  \n   This will return the **accessTokenId**, which is required for the next step.\n\n3. **Set Headers and Call the Event Endpoint**  \n   Notify the server that you have successfully obtained the **accessTokenId**:  \n    - In Swagger UI, make a request with the following:  \n      - **Headers:**  \n        - **x-sse-id**: Your **sseId**  \n        - **x-token-id**: Your **accessTokenId**  \n      - **Body:**  \n        - **redirect**: **false**  \n        - **clientId**: Client ID obtained from Plurality  \n\n   This will provide the **accessToken** in the \"Register Event\" tab.\n",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-sse-id",
            "in": "header",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "x-token-id",
            "in": "header",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OK"
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Bad Request"
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal Server Error"
          }
        },
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "redirect": {
                    "example": "any"
                  },
                  "clientAppId": {
                    "example": "any"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
